<!-- This file is the EJS template for the admin panel of the campus marketplace application. -->
<!-- It contains the basic structure and styling for the admin panel. -->

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-HK">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Admin 管理後台</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif;max-width:1000px;margin:24px auto;padding:0 20px;background:#f3f6f8}
.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce5ea;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:16px}
a{color:#006b9f}
.btn{display:inline-block;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #006b9f;background:#006b9f;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;margin:4px}
.btn.danger{background:#9c2929;border-color:#9c2929}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
<h1>管理後台</h1>
<p>管理員：<%= user.username %></p>
<a href="/list" class="btn">返回市集</a>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>管理功能</h3>
<ul>
<li>✅ 可以直接在市集頁面編輯、刪除所有用戶的商品</li>
<li>✅ 可以修改任何商品的售賣狀態</li>
</ul>
<p>備註：商品操作直接在市集頁面執行，這裡是管理員入口頁</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
